    "body": "Merge-batch refresh: merged `upstream/main` into the branch (merge commit 88187a03, no rebase, no force).\n\nHand-resolved hunk (one): the `pub mod`/`pub use` block in `crates/app/src/stock_sim.rs`. I kept this PR's `#[path = \"stock_sim_wire.rs\"] pub mod wire;` (and its #1110 comment) and took main's `pub use carry::{...}` and `held::{...}` lines exactly as they are on main. No other conflicts.\n\nGate on the merged tree:\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --lib`: 148 passed\n- `stock_sim_document` 9, `setup_carry` 9, `post_not_judged` 4, `cutting_data` 6, `tool_list` 6, `posting` 17, `verify` 21 (2 ignored, heavy lane), `wire_contour` 7, `wire_readers` 7: all passed\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean\n\nReady for a delta review of the remerge-diff (`git show --remerge-diff 88187a03`).\n",
